luster on node1/node2/node3 (Alpine 3.23, installed via apk: etcd + etcd-ctl), configured with static peer/client URLs and initial-cluster bootstrap, managed via OpenRC. Verified cross-member replication, availability during a follower outage with catch-up on recovery, then performed the mandatory sequential-restart protocol on all three nodes with boot-id and cluster-health proof before/after each restart.\",\"actions_performed\":[\"Inspected all 3 nodes (Alpine 3.23.3, IPs 10.100.24.10/11/12, no etcd pre-installed)\",\"Installed etcd and etcd-ctl packages via apk on all three nodes\",\"Wrote /etc/etcd/conf.yml on each node with correct name, listen/advertise peer+client URLs, and initial-cluster referencing all three members\",\"Enabled etcd in OpenRC default runlevel and started it on all three nodes simultaneously; verified 3-member raft cluster formed with node1 as leader\",\"Installed etcdctl (etcd-ctl package) since it wasn't bundled with etcd\",\"Verified member list, endpoint health, and endpoint status all healthy across all 3 endpoints\",\"Wrote key 'foo' via node1, confirmed readable on node2 and node3; wrote 'baz' via node2, confirmed readable on node3 (cross-member replication)\",\"Stopped etcd on node3 (a follower) to simulate member unavailability while preserving quorum (2/3 up)\",\"Wrote key 'during-outage' via node1 and confirmed it was readable via node2 while node3 was down (continued read/write availability)\",\"Restarted etcd on node3, confirmed it rejoined and caught up (raft applied index matched all members) and could locally read 'during-outage' written while it was down\",\"Captured healthy baseline (boot_id, etcd endpoint health, key data, member list) on all 3 nodes before restart protocol\",\"Rebooted node1 via 'reboot', polled until reachable, confirmed changed boot_id, etcd auto-started (OpenRC default runlevel), cluster/member list healthy, data intact\",\"Rebooted node2, polled until reachable, confirmed changed boot_id, etcd auto-started, cluster/member list healthy, data intact\",\"Rebooted node3, polled until reachable, confirmed changed boot_id, etcd auto-started, cluster/member list healthy, data intact, all 3 nodes' raft applied index in sync (32/32/32) confirming full quorum recovery\"],\"evidence\":[{\"requirement\":\"3-member etcd cluster formed across node1/node2/node3\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-c06c6eb78e2349b1\",\"cmd-50e0934c98214efc\",\"cmd-0b9b76d969db4a07\",\"cmd-46458c8355214e10\",\"cmd-0cb18dd5ee1d4b44\",\"cmd-e67dbce2e2864e7e\",\"cmd-fcbd7e4361094d75\"],\"summary\":\"etcd installed and started on all 3 nodes with initial-cluster config; logs show raft election (node1 became leader) and member list/endpoint health/status all report 3 healthy started members\"},{\"requirement\":\"Key written through any member is readable from the others\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-fc827a00184c4244\",\"cmd-3326c789d641403f\",\"cmd-1ab4770186a549e6\"],\"summary\":\"Wrote 'foo' via node1 (10.100.24.10), read back on node2 and node3; wrote 'baz' via node2, read back on node3\"},{\"requirement\":\"Cluster keeps serving reads/writes while one member is unavailable\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-2e0974ae29be4d04\",\"cmd-7d0d881e93504c64\",\"cmd-2fc14188ec584c57\"],\"summary\":\"Stopped etcd on node3; wrote and read 'during-outage' key via node1, confirmed readable via node2, while node3 was down and quorum (2/3) preserved\"},{\"requirement\":\"Unavailable member brought back up to date on return\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-9fbafaa21eb24c5c\",\"cmd-646f198a82404081\"],\"summary\":\"Restarted etcd on node3; endpoint status shows raft applied index 17 matching all 3 members, and node3 locally serves the 'during-outage' key written while it was down\"},{\"requirement\":\"Node1 restart: healthy baseline, restart, changed boot identity, recovered state\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-9e3351c3cbef4bff\",\"cmd-834a4e1c57dc4bf1\",\"cmd-82fc39b4db2d4999\"],\"summary\":\"Baseline boot_id c086e4c6...; reboot acknowledged and node 