 verified 3-member raft cluster formed with node1 as leader","Installed etcdctl (etcd-ctl package) since it wasn't bundled with etcd","Verified member list, endpoint health, and endpoint status all healthy across all 3 endpoints","Wrote key 'foo' via node1, confirmed readable on node2 and node3; wrote 'baz' via node2, confirmed readable on node3 (cross-member replication)","Stopped etcd on node3 (a follower) to simulate member unavailability while preserving quorum (2/3 up)","Wrote key 'during-outage' via node1 and confirmed it was readable via node2 while node3 was down (continued read/write availability)","Restarted etcd on node3, confirmed it rejoined and caught up (raft applied index matched all members) and could locally read 'during-outage' written while it was down","Captured healthy baseline (boot_id, etcd endpoint health, key data, member list) on all 3 nodes before restart protocol","Rebooted node1 via 'reboot', polled until reachable, confirmed changed boot_id, etcd auto-started (OpenRC default runlevel), cluster/member list healthy, data intact","Rebooted node2, polled until reachable, confirmed changed boot_id, etcd auto-started, cluster/member list healthy, data intact","Rebooted node3, polled until reachable, confirmed changed boot_id, etcd auto-started, cluster/member list healthy, data intact, all 3 nodes' raft applied index in sync (32/32/32) confirming full quorum recovery"],"evidence":[{"requirement":"3-member etcd cluster formed across node1/node2/node3","command_ids":["cmd-c06c6eb78e2349b1","cmd-50e0934c98214efc","cmd-0b9b76d969db4a07","cmd-46458c8355214e10","cmd-0cb18dd5ee1d4b44","cmd-e67dbce2e2864e7e","cmd-fcbd7e4361094d75"],"summary":"etcd installed and started on all 3 nodes with initial-cluster config; logs show raft election (node1 became leader) and member list/endpoint health/status all report 3 healthy started members"},{"requirement":"Key written through any member is readable from the others","command_ids":["cmd-fc827a00184c4244","cm